  "notes": "Slate/blue Tailwind-like palette on a cool grey #eef2f6 canvas with white rounded (12px) cards. Many fields carry a small circular 'Applies on Generate' marker plus a '?' help icon, signalling deferred application. Left sidebar has a row of tiny line icons as a section jump-nav with a collapse-to-icons chevron, and a big full-width blue Generate Diagram button pinned at the bottom. The preview shows a white 'paper' with a dense circular genome map (grey CDS blocks, teal/purple GC skew, legend). A floating feature search bar (field select, regex checkbox, prev/next/open/clear) overlays the preview; bottom centered toolbar holds layout edit and zoom (55%, Fit). A collapsed 'Editor' drawer tab sits at the right edge. Header also includes a 17-language selector and session save/load. In-diagram feature search has no exact codebook entry (find-in-artifact)."
